  "label": "Hateful",
  "description": "The meme directly attacks the historical memory of the Holocaust and the moral gravity of the event by trivializing the suffering of Jewish victims through mockery and indifference. It uses the image of Adolf Hitler, the architect of the Holocaust, to symbolize the perpetrator of mass atrocities, and juxtaposes it with the text 'anne frankly i don't care' to imply apathy toward genocide. This is a form of antisemitic hate speech that minimizes the horror of the Holocaust, which is a well-documented antisemitic trope.",
